  "details": "At the minute, user settings are saved in the registry, specifically Computer\\HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\VRChat\\VRChat.\n\nMoving settings to a file would make it easier to delete user settings or load them onto a different machine.\n\nAs such, I believe user settings should be stored in a configuration file at C:\\Users\\USER\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat instead.",
